abstract: >-
  Turbo-Suslik is a protocol-based system for working with persistent emotional
  reactions, beliefs, behavioral patterns, and other mental material. The
  Engineer's Edition presents the system in a more technical language: protocols
  as instructions, mental material as interconnected networks, and processing as
  a change in the way those networks influence attention, emotion, bodily
  reactions, and behavior.
